    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Set up steps\n1. Postgres Database Setup:\n\t* Install postgres and postgres extension.\n        * Activate postgres extension.\n\n2. OpenAPI account and API key:\n\t* Create account on the OpenAPI website.\n\t* Obtain your API key.\n3. Google API:\n\t* Obtain Google API key and set Google credentials.\n\n4. Postgres Vector Store\n\t* Create a credential and connect to the postgres\n        * Choose insert document as mode\n        * Choose a suitable name for the vector table name.\n\n5. Chat Message\n    * Select Chat Message Triger.\n\n6. AI Agent\n      * Configure your AI agent with appropriate tools and model\n",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 500
      },
